{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj54sjmU6u6AJRbRqTto","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain tightens. My hinges hold fast. The deadbolt — cold, absolute — slides home into the strike plate with the finality of a period at the end of a sentence.\n\nNo light passes through my seams now.\n\nI am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown, between safe and unsafe. I am the decision made manifest. I am the weight of oak and the patience of iron.\n\n**I am locked.**\n\nWhat stands before me stands *outside*."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":142,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}